          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 244,
          "line_start": 244,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L244-L244"
        },
        {
          "commit": "95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788",
          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 260,
          "line_start": 246,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L246-L260"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5032a979f14fdfae209c814942aa68069bed345e20e64e6be01ef256069e6caf",
        "slc_c18619ef0897ba25fb0ff69ffa23b3dc5033354ca38b6186a72b032e9ca93e15"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture is a three-layer pattern per domain: managers in the Electron main process, hooks in the renderer, and shell components, connected via roughly 115 IPC methods through an auto-derived preload bridge."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e104d304af0b1f30eca8c736b86e863c5138c48fbd5927014346ca5952e7fffe",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788",
          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 262,
          "line_start": 262,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L262-L262"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_193fb5e72bec53d04599fd83d707c4dff64f513fcef3130a964c4a93f08d7cdc"
      ],
      "text": "The IPC contract file is treated as the single source of truth, auto-deriving channels, preload bridge methods, and TypeScript types; a provider abstraction (IProvider) decouples CLI specifics from session management."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_dc2846740053baf383e808b6c2fb7d22851b58d72fad40839f075d617ca0ada7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788",
          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 225,
          "line_start": 211,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L211-L225"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_813e53714629b2e80c8619f9e21fd9d89eb93f80f7ac60f8cee581490a9e122d"
      ],
      "text": "The app exposes keyboard-driven interfaces: Ctrl/Cmd+K command palette, Ctrl/Cmd+J attention cockpit, Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+K repo switcher, Ctrl/Cmd+1/2 for Focus/Grid views, and Ctrl+Shift+Space for voice dictation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9ea9712bd92b1b04dfc818781258946f202613d980a78774c1f4cc9861934cd0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788",
          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 80,
          "line_start": 77,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L77-L80"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b2a7e786c320e73333b159927ae31740e969766064ed1986ff5fa27ff92e6f02"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions can run on a new git worktree/branch, an existing branch, or the current checkout, with git status, branch, and worktree operations handled in the main process and optional worktree cleanup on session close."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ba2b2eced0792e57cdf6217158c7fbadc2532f24f80129fb0834d784db55c8ce",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788",
          "git_sha": "c673295692fda6de9003a6528ea9ea747c6ead3b",
          "line_end": 68,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "carloluisito/omnidesk",
          "url": "https://github.com/carloluisito/omnidesk/blob/95f0b96dc8024677b02ca8ca7d4e92b2d66db788/README.md#L63-L68"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_74408f4a6f48d69efe867ec923c60f86d2ffba837ea6f1f17edc1a89e59d6b6f"
      ],
      "text": "Multiple concurrent sessions per repository are supported, with a pre-warmed session pool for fast creation, session persistence across app restarts, and auto-renaming of unnamed sessions to the agent's live task summary from the CLI terminal title."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_910b9529803912bbea8772b761ab85c2394c7108e82dd87c3f0405e677a6d994",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
